flowchart LR
    subgraph Producer[收包线程]
        RX[CAN报文<br/>仪表/六轴/雷达]
    end
    subgraph Core[CanSignalMgr]
        REG[信号注册表]
        SLOT[信号槽 O(1)索引]
        TO[超时监控 500ms]
        VER[version变化检测]
        BATCH[批量更新 单锁]
    end
    subgraph Consumer[业务线程]
        ALG[算法/三急/倒车]
    end
    subgraph Monitor[超时监控线程 1s(可选)]
        CHK[checkTimeout 可选<br/>置无效+回调]
    end
    RX -->|逐项update| SLOT
    REG --> SLOT
    SLOT -->|getWithTime 带有效性| ALG
    TO --> SLOT
    VER --> SLOT
    BATCH --> SLOT
    SLOT --> CHK
